%% Fact Knowledge Layer — architecture
%% Render: https://mermaid.live  (paste this file)  or  mmdc -i architecture.mmd -o architecture.png
%% The three stages answer three questions: where exactly did this come from,
%% what does it say, and does it agree with everything else we know.

flowchart TB

  IN["PDF in<br/>drag onto the UI, or the CLI"]

  subgraph S1["1 · GROUND IT — ingest/"]
    direction TB
    L["Line geometry<br/>PyMuPDF, per rendered line"]
    C["Recursive column split<br/>widest whitespace gutter<br/>handles 2-page spreads of 2 columns"]
    P["Paragraph reassembly<br/>joins a line only if the previous one<br/>reached the column margin"]
    T["Page text + cell layer<br/>every character offset is an anchor"]
    L --> C --> P --> T
  end

  subgraph S2["2 · DESCRIBE IT — extract/, one parser per dimension"]
    direction TB
    U["Sentences and table rows"]
    PE["Period<br/>FY24 = 2023-24 = FY2023/24"]
    QT["Quantity<br/>scale, unit, sign, precision"]
    QL["Qualifier<br/>consolidation, vintage, real/nominal<br/>editable JSON lexicon"]
    ME["Metric phrase<br/>syntactic walk left from the number<br/>no dictionary of known metrics"]
    GE["Cell geometry<br/>slide caption, column header"]
    F["FACT<br/>subject · metric · value · unit<br/>period · basis · evidence span"]
    U --> PE
    U --> QT
    U --> QL
    U --> ME
    GE -.->|"names the value<br/>when words do not"| ME
    PE --> F
    QT --> F
    QL --> F
    ME --> F
  end

  subgraph S3["3 · COMPARE IT — knowledge/"]
    direction TB
    CO["Concept induction<br/>IDF over metric phrases<br/>incremental, no taxonomy"]
    B1["Candidate pairs<br/>same concept, same unit"]
    B2["Value bridge<br/>different words, same subject,<br/>period, unit and grounded value"]
    R["Context-first classifier<br/>rule out every explanation<br/>before calling a conflict"]
    CO --> B1 --> R
    CO --> B2 --> R
  end

  DB["SQLite<br/>documents · pages · facts<br/>relations · concepts · FTS5"]
  OUT["OUT<br/>UI and JSON API · four-case report · samples/"]
  LLM["Optional Claude pass<br/>may rewrite only the description<br/>quotes verified verbatim against the page"]

  IN --> L
  T --> U
  F --> CO
  R --> DB
  DB --> OUT
  F -.->|"only the facts<br/>the rules were unsure of"| LLM
  LLM -.-> CO

  classDef io fill:#e7edff,stroke:#3352cc,color:#101321,stroke-width:1px
  classDef fact fill:#e6f4ec,stroke:#1f7a4d,color:#101321,stroke-width:1px
  classDef store fill:#f3f0ff,stroke:#6741d9,color:#101321,stroke-width:1px
  classDef opt fill:#fdf4e3,stroke:#a35a00,color:#101321

  class IN,OUT io
  class F fact
  class DB store
  class LLM opt
